l;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;margin: 1.12em 0.0px;orphans: 2;padding: 0.0px;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">港版和國行是全網通支持雙卡雙待,美版是無鎖全網通不支持雙卡雙待</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">官方標配國行/港版/美版都是全新未激活,全套原裝配件現貨當天發！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">支持深圳同城閃送，2小時送達運費自理。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/20543624/O1CN01XqVkbm1cdpu1SfOkp_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">歡迎光臨十五年淘寶老店超盈國際HK，</span><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">本店專注蘋果新品發售已有十載，很多客戶從iPhone4開始就關注本店。可先收藏加購本寶貝，時刻關注新款iPhone11&amp; iPhone11 Pro&amp;iPhone 11 Pro Max到貨情況及優惠價。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/205