mal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;margin: 1.12em 0.0px;orphans: 2;padding: 0.0px;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">港版和國行是全網通支持雙卡雙待,美版是無鎖全網通不支持雙卡雙待</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">官方標配國行/港版/美版都是全新未激活,全套原裝配件現貨當天發！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">支持深圳同城閃送，2小時送達運費自理。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/20543624/O1CN01XqVkbm1cdpu1SfOkp_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">歡迎光臨十五年淘寶老店超盈國際HK，</span><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">本店專注蘋果新品發售已有十載，很多客戶從iPhone4開始就關注本店。可先收藏加購本寶貝，時刻關注新款iPhone11&amp; iPhone11 Pro&amp;iPhone 11 Pro Max到貨情況及優惠價。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/20543624/O1CN01jOgbbi1cdptw1I1jV_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/20543624/O1CN01KF9FXG1cdpu0h7vX8_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;margin: 1.12em 0.0px;orphans: 2;padding: 0.0px;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">官方標配：全新原封未激活,原裝充電器數據線耳機零售機；</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;margin: 1.12em 0.0px;orphans: 2;padding: 0.0px;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24.0px;\">套餐六美版；全新無鎖三網通近期激活，原裝充電器數據線耳機；</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0.0px;padding: 0.0px;color: #000000;font-size: 14.0px;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0.0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0.0px;background-color: #ffffff;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/20543624/O1CN015yjRPO1cdpu2RvT3a_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/20543624/O1CN01WL2J2W1cdptwyzp1J_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/20543624/O1CN010ZGy3U1cdpu0VMmKG_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/20543624/O1CN01pKBrPY1cdptyWQrC0_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/20543624/O1CN01xVTrJ41cdptz5lJLq_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/></p><p style=\"margin: 1.12em 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/20543624/O1CN01gBNcZl1cdptbsKdON_!!20543624.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"/></p>', '', 1392, '2020-11-17 17:37:57', NULL, 0, 'a:5:{s:3:\"cbj\";s:4:\"5788\";s:2:\"yj\";s:4:\"5788\";s:2:\"sj\";s:4:\"5788\";s:4:\"unit\";s:3:\"件\";s:5:\"kucun\";s:3:\"100\";}', ',1,', 7195, 10, 3, 153, 0, 0, '淘宝,掏宝,网上购物,店铺, 现货Apple/苹果 iPhone 11 Pro 苹果11国行港版美版 新款双卡手机.', '12.00', NULL, 0, '112', 0, '0', 0, '', 0, '', '1', 170, 2, NULL, 53, ',0,', '百货集', 0, NULL, 2, 0, 'a6022232401132.jpg', 0, 0);
