mg.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i3/2601620633/O1CN01NPaioq1GXxKgJvkEC_!!2601620633-0-lubanu-s.jpg_240x240.jpg\" style=\"background-position: center;background-repeat: no-repeat;border: 1.0px solid #e0e0e0;\"><a href=\"http://item.taobao.com/item.htm?id=627034184599\" style=\"display: block;width: 235.0px;height: 235.0px;text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;</a></td>\n									<td width=\"10\">&nbsp;</td>\n								</tr>\n								<tr>\n									<td height=\"10\" style=\"line-height: 0.0px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n								</tr>\n							\n						</table>\n						</div>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n				\n			</table>\n			</div>\n			</div>\n			</div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	\n</table>\n\n<div><a name=\"hlg_list_1_35852686_end\"></a></div>\n\n<div class=\"dm_module\" data-id=\"9525198\" data-title=\"寶貝描述\" id=\"ids-module-9525198\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/2601620633/TB29Rw5v3RkpuFjy1zeXXc.6FXa_!!2601620633.jpg\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\">材質：銅鍍金+水鑽</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\">規格：手鐲長約14CM</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 手錬長約48+3CM</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">手工測量，存在誤差，僅作參考</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">這款的價格偏貴，但是韓國這家檔口的東西本身拿貨就貴</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">他們家的款式都很有設計感，材質全部做的是黃銅厚鍍18K金，質量很過關</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">所以拿貨價很貴，但是在韓國當地很受歡迎</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">平心而論，我們定的這個價格已經是很劃算咯</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">鑲鑽的手鐲因為本身線條比較細，然後又有鑲鑽工藝</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">所以難免會有彎曲，但是戴手上不明顯</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">介意者慎拍！</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/2601620633/TB26igds4hmpuFjSZFyXXcLdFXa_!!2601620633.jpg\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/2601620633/O1CN0127UqAk1GXxJXU9Ctc_!!2601620633.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/2601620633/O1CN01w9pmJ01GXxJTYbWJj_!!2601620633.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/2601620633/O1CN01F5J8CB1GXxJWMVihj_!!2601620633.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 750.0px;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" src=\