 style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 手錬長約48+3CM</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">手工測量，存在誤差，僅作參考</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">這款的價格偏貴，但是韓國這家檔口的東西本身拿貨就貴</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">他們家的款式都很有設計感，材質全部做的是黃銅厚鍍18K金，質量很過關</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">所以拿貨價很貴，但是在韓國當地很受歡迎</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">平心而論，我們定的這個價格已經是很劃算咯</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">鑲鑽的手鐲因為本身線條比較細，然後又有鑲鑽工藝</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">所以難免會有彎曲，但是戴手上不明顯</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: microsoft yahei;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">介意者慎拍！</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\